    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "**Essere** (to be) is irregular and one of the most-used verbs in Italian:\n\nio **sono** · tu **sei** · lui/lei **è** · noi **siamo** · voi **siete** · loro **sono**" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "it-ex-essere-1" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "it-ex-essere-2" },
    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "**Piacere** literally means \"pleasure\" and is what you say when meeting someone for the first time." },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "it-ex-essere-3" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "it-ex-essere-4" }
  ],
